{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04787","headline":"别㴩湖 · 张说","name":"别㴩湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"念别㴩湖去，浮舟更一临。\n千峰出浪险，万木抱烟深。\n南郡延恩渥，东山恋宿心。\n露花香欲醉，时鸟啭余音。\n涉趣皆留赏，无奇不徧寻。\n莫言山水间，幽意在鸣琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}